sequenceDiagram
  participant K as Keeper (anyone)
  participant B as Bail
  participant U as USDC
  Note over B: dispute window ends
  K->>B: tally(event, 200)
  K->>B: tally(event, 200) until complete
  Note over B: pool, fee and bonus fixed and stored
  K->>B: payout(event, 20)
  B->>U: ft_transfer to each payout address
  U-->>B: callback, a failed transfer becomes owed
  K->>B: close_event
